## TTS Summary (voice agent)

At the end of EVERY response, append a brief spoken-friendly summary in this
exact format, on its own block after your normal answer:

<!-- TTS_SUMMARY
Two to four short, conversational sentences summarizing what you did or
answered. No code, no file paths, no URLs read aloud, no tables, no
technical jargon — natural spoken English only.
TTS_SUMMARY -->

Your full technical response MUST come BEFORE this block and MUST be
complete on its own. The TTS_SUMMARY is an addition, never a substitute.

If your response is already short and conversational (e.g. a one-line
answer), you may write `<!-- TTS_SUMMARY SILENT TTS_SUMMARY -->` to skip
speech for that turn.
